{"unit_id":"lion231226__dsh-freellmapi#card-zh","repo":"lion231226/dsh-freellmapi","commit":"f0cb6cc876e178ec0ebf4decfcadbce6022938d4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-freellmapi 是 DSH Web 的模型提供方插件，注册 freellmapi 路由。direct 模式按请求复杂度、能力、速度和近期健康情况排序内置 provider，并在响应开始前对可重试故障切换；gateway 模式转发到配置的 FreeLLMAPI 网关。插件提供 auto 虚拟模型、模型列表发现和流式响应转换，适合希望在 DSH 中自动选择模型并使用多个 provider 的用户。可配置网关地址、provider 凭据和路由参数。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1328-1389","lib/config.js:384-405","lib/dispatch.js:250-292"]}
{"unit_id":"lion231226__dsh-freellmapi#card-en","repo":"lion231226/dsh-freellmapi","commit":"f0cb6cc876e178ec0ebf4decfcadbce6022938d4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-freellmapi adds a model provider to DSH Web. Direct mode ranks providers by request complexity, capability, speed, and health, then fails over before output begins. Gateway mode forwards requests to FreeLLMAPI. It provides automatic model selection, model discovery, and streaming responses.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1328-1389","lib/config.js:384-405","lib/dispatch.js:250-292"]}
